  "todayHardToTalkTry3": "Dikirani yankho. Yankhani maganizo omwe ali kumbuyo kwa mawu, ndipo gawanani chithunzi.",
  "todayVisit": "Kuchezera kapena kuyimba foni kwayandikira",
  "todayVisitTry1": "Apatseni moni potchula dzina lawo ndipo auzeni kuti ndinu ndani: “Moni Amayi, ndine Susan, mwana wanu wamkazi.”",
  "todayVisitTry2": "Bweretsani chinthu chimodzi kapena ziwiri zogawana: buku la zithunzi, nyimbo yomwe amakonda, bulangeti lofewa.",
