  "habitsTitle": "Makhalidwe oyenera kukambirana",
  "habitsIntro": "Makhalidwe awa amalumikizidwa ndi mwayi wochepa wa dementia pakati pa magulu akulu a anthu. Si lonjezo kwa munthu aliyense. Palibe khalidwe, masewera kapena zakudya zomwe zatsimikizika kuteteza dementia.",
  "habitsHearingVisionTitle": "Kuyang’ana kumva ndi kuona",
  "habitsHearingVisionBody": "Kutaya kumva ndi kuona komwe sikunachiritsidwe kumalumikizidwa ndi chiopsezo chokwera cha dementia. Kuyang’ana ndi kofulumira, ndipo kuchiza chimodzi chilichonse kungapangitse moyo wa tsiku ndi tsiku kukhala wosavuta ngakhale zitakhala zotani pa chiopsezo cha dementia.",
  "habitsHeartTitle": "Kuthamanga kwa magazi ndi mafuta m’magazi",
  "habitsHeartBody": "Kuthamanga kwa magazi kwambiri ndi mafuta ambiri m’magazi pa zaka zapakati kumalumikizidwa ndi chiopsezo chokwera cha dementia. Dokotala angayang’ane zonsezi ndi kukambirana zomwe zikukuyenererani.",
  "habitsMoveTitle": "Sunthani thupi lanu",
  "habitsMoveBody": "Kukhala wolimbikira pa thupi kumalumikizidwa ndi chiopsezo chochepa cha dementia ndipo kumathandiza thanzi m’njira zina. Sankhani chinthu chomwe mumakonda ndipo mungapitirize kuchita, ndipo funsani dokotala kaye ngati simukudziwa.",
  "habitsConnectTitle": "Khalani pafupi ndi anthu",
  "habitsConnectBody": "Kudzipatula kwa anthu kumalumikizidwa ndi chiopsezo chokwera cha dementia. Nthawi yokhazikika ndi anzanu, banja kapena gulu ndi yoyenera kuipatsa malo.",
  "habitsSmokeTitle": "Kusuta ndi mowa",
  "habitsSmokeBody": "Kusuta ndi kumwa mowa kwambiri zimalumikizidwa ndi chiopsezo chokwera cha dementia. Ngati mukufuna kuchepetsa kapena kusiya, dokotala kapena ntchito ya m’dera lanu ingathandize.",
  "habitsHeadTitle": "Tetezani mutu wanu",
  "habitsHeadBody": "Kuvulala kumutu kumalumikizidwa ndi chiopsezo chokwera cha dementia. Chipewa chotetezera pokwera njinga ndi kusamala pa masitepe ndi m’galimoto ndi njira zosavuta.",
  "habitsDoctorNote": "Palibe chilichonse mwa izi chomwe chilowa m’malo mwa upangiri wa dokotala. Ngati muli ndi nkhawa ya kukumbukira kwanu kapena ya dementia, kambiranani ndi dokotala.",
  "habitsSourcesTitle": "Kumene izi zimachokera",
  "habitsSources": "Lancet Commission ya 2024 yokhudza kupewa, kuchitapo kanthu ndi chisamaliro cha dementia. Ziwerengero zake zimafotokoza anthu onse, osati munthu mmodzi. Chitsogozo chokhala ndi magwero chili pa dementiaactivities.games (mu Chingerezi).",
